flowchart TB
  install[npm ci + Astro cache] --> lint[lint + contrast]
  lint --> tests[unit, data, PGlite integration]
  tests --> branch[Neon branch: migrate + seed, if a key exists]
  branch --> build2[build, retried once]
  build2 --> budget2[JS budget]
  budget2 --> pw[Playwright on Chromium and WebKit]
  pw --> cleanup[delete the Neon branch]
